{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "notion-ext",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "Notion",
  "description": "Your Notion workspace in Zeff, both ways: pages, databases and rows under the page My Notion, kept in step a few seconds after either side changes.",
  "icon": "📓",
  "localize": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "kind": "page",
      "title": "Notion",
      "icon": "🔄",
      "content": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your Notion pages, databases and rows are kept in step with the page My Notion (below this one): what changes in Notion comes in within about 15 seconds, what you change in Zeff goes to Notion a few seconds after you stop typing."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Setting it up"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. In Notion: Settings → Connections → Develop or manage integrations → New integration (internal). Copy its secret."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. In Zeff: Menu → Plugins → Notion → ⚙️ Settings: paste the secret as Notion token."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. In Notion: open each top page you want in Zeff → ••• → Connections → add your integration. Its sub-pages and databases come along."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Optional: a Notion page as the place for pages you make right under My Notion in Zeff (setting “New pages from Zeff go to”). Without it, pages you make under synced pages still go to Notion."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What is kept"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Text with headings, lists, to-dos, toggles, quotes, callouts, code, equations, tables, columns, dividers, pictures (kept in Zeff — Notion's links expire), sub-pages and databases with their rows and fields. What only Zeff has (widgets, code cells, mentions of todos) stays in Zeff; what only Notion has (bookmarks, embeds, synced blocks, files) shows in Zeff as a link to it in Notion and stays in Notion as long as you leave that line as it is."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The two flows below do the work — open them to see each run (Studio → Flows)."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "parent": "i1",
      "kind": "page",
      "title": "My Notion",
      "icon": "📓",
      "content": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everything below this page is kept in step with Notion."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "parent": "i1",
      "kind": "page",
      "title": "Sync from Notion",
      "icon": "⬇️",
      "flow": {
        "name": "notion.pull",
        "title": "Sync from Notion",
        "description": "What changed in Notion comes into Zeff: new and changed pages, databases and rows (under the page My Notion), merged with what you wrote in Zeff meanwhile; what Notion moved to its trash goes to Zeff's. Asked every 15 seconds whether there is anything (one small request), run only then — and every 5 minutes anyway.",
        "inputs": [],
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "plan",
            "kind": "action",
            "action": "lambda.invoke",
            "input": {
              "name": "notion.pull",
              "event": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "each",
            "kind": "foreach",
            "items": "steps.plan.ops",
            "as": "op",
            "max": 1000,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "par",
                "kind": "if",
                "when": "op.parentNotion",
                "then": [
                  {
                    "id": "pq",
                    "kind": "action",
                    "action": "store.query",
                    "input": {
                      "store": "notion-ext.links",
                      "where": {
                        "notion_id": "{{ op.parentNotion }}"
                      },
                      "limit": 1
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "ps",
                    "kind": "set",
                    "vars": {
                      "parent": "{{ steps.pq.rows[0].zeff_id | default('@notion-ext.i2') }}"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "else": [
                  {
                    "id": "pr",
                    "kind": "set",
                    "vars": {
                      "parent": "@notion-ext.i2"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "which",
                "kind": "switch",
                "on": "op.op",
                "cases": [
                  {
                    "value": "page.create",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "mk",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.create",
                          "args": {
                            "title": "{{ op.title | default('Untitled') }}",
                            "icon": "{{ op.icon }}",
                            "cover": "{{ op.cover }}",
                            "parent": "{{ vars.parent }}",
                            "doc": "{{ op.doc }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "mkl",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "mkz",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}",
                              "zeff_id": "{{ steps.mk.id }}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "mkp",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.pictures",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "mkpk",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "files.keep-page",
                            "input": {
                              "page": "{{ steps.mk.id }}"
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "page.update",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "pu",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.update",
                          "args": {
                            "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                            "title": "{{ op.title | default('Untitled') }}",
                            "icon": "{{ op.icon }}",
                            "cover": "{{ op.cover }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pum",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.parentNotion",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "pmv",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "meta.run",
                            "input": {
                              "op": "page.update",
                              "args": {
                                "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                                "parent": "{{ vars.parent }}"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pccur",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.read",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.read",
                          "args": {
                            "id": "{{ op.zeff }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pcmg",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "lambda.invoke",
                        "input": {
                          "name": "notion.merge",
                          "event": {
                            "current": "{{ steps.pccur.doc }}",
                            "base": "{{ op.base }}",
                            "theirs": "{{ op.theirs }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pcw",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "not steps.pcmg.same",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "pcdoc",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "meta.run",
                            "input": {
                              "op": "page.update",
                              "args": {
                                "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                                "doc": "{{ steps.pcmg.doc }}"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pcl",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pcb",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}",
                              "base": "{{ steps.pcmg.base | json }}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "pup",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.pictures",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "pupk",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "files.keep-page",
                            "input": {
                              "page": "{{ op.zeff }}"
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "database.create",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "dm",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "database.create",
                          "args": {
                            "title": "{{ op.title }}",
                            "icon": "{{ op.icon }}",
                            "parent": "{{ vars.parent }}",
                            "titleName": "{{ op.titleName }}",
                            "properties": "{{ op.properties }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "dml",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "dmz",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}",
                              "zeff_id": "{{ steps.dm.id }}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "database.update",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "du",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.update",
                          "args": {
                            "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                            "title": "{{ op.title }}",
                            "icon": "{{ op.icon }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "dua",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.alter.length > 0",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "dal",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "meta.run",
                            "input": {
                              "op": "database.alter",
                              "args": {
                                "database": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                                "ops": "{{ op.alter }}"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "dul",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "row.create",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "rq",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.query",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "where": {
                            "notion_id": "{{ op.database }}"
                          },
                          "limit": 1
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "ra",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "db.add",
                        "input": {
                          "database": "{{ steps.rq.rows[0].zeff_id }}",
                          "title": "{{ op.title | default('Untitled') }}",
                          "values": "{{ op.values }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "rc",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "not op.empty or op.icon",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "rcd",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "meta.run",
                            "input": {
                              "op": "page.update",
                              "args": {
                                "id": "{{ steps.ra.id }}",
                                "icon": "{{ op.icon }}",
                                "doc": "{{ op.doc }}"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "ral",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "raz",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}",
                              "zeff_id": "{{ steps.ra.id }}"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "rap",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.pictures",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "rapk",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "files.keep-page",
                            "input": {
                              "page": "{{ steps.ra.id }}"
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "row.update",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "ru",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "db.update",
                        "input": {
                          "row": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                          "title": "{{ op.title | default('Untitled') }}",
                          "values": "{{ op.values }}"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "rui",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.update",
                          "args": {
                            "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                            "icon": "{{ op.icon }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "ruc",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.contentChanged",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "rmcur",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "meta.read",
                            "input": {
                              "op": "page.read",
                              "args": {
                                "id": "{{ op.zeff }}"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "rmmg",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "lambda.invoke",
                            "input": {
                              "name": "notion.merge",
                              "event": {
                                "current": "{{ steps.rmcur.doc }}",
                                "base": "{{ op.base }}",
                                "theirs": "{{ op.theirs }}"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "rmw",
                            "kind": "if",
                            "when": "not steps.rmmg.same",
                            "then": [
                              {
                                "id": "rmdoc",
                                "kind": "action",
                                "action": "meta.run",
                                "input": {
                                  "op": "page.update",
                                  "args": {
                                    "id": "{{ op.zeff }}",
                                    "doc": "{{ steps.rmmg.doc }}"
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            ],
                            "else": []
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "rml",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "store.put",
                            "input": {
                              "store": "notion-ext.links",
                              "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "rmb",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "store.put",
                            "input": {
                              "store": "notion-ext.links",
                              "rows": [
                                {
                                  "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}",
                                  "base": "{{ steps.rmmg.base | json }}"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": [
                          {
                            "id": "rul",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "store.put",
                            "input": {
                              "store": "notion-ext.links",
                              "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "rup",
                        "kind": "if",
                        "when": "op.pictures",
                        "then": [
                          {
                            "id": "rupk",
                            "kind": "action",
                            "action": "files.keep-page",
                            "input": {
                              "page": "{{ op.zeff }}"
                            }
                          }
                        ],
                        "else": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "archive",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "ar",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "meta.run",
                        "input": {
                          "op": "page.archive",
                          "args": {
                            "id": "{{ op.zeff }}"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "ard",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.delete",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "where": {
                            "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "unlink",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "ul",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.delete",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "where": {
                            "notion_id": "{{ op.notion }}"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "link",
                    "nodes": [
                      {
                        "id": "lk",
                        "kind": "action",
                        "action": "store.put",
                        "input": {
                          "store": "notion-ext.links",
                          "rows": "{{ op.rows }}"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "default": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "st",
            "kind": "action",
            "action": "store.put",
            "input": {
              "store": "notion-ext.state",
              "rows": [
                {
                  "name": "cursor",
                  "value": "{{ steps.plan.cursor }}"
                },
                {
                  "name": "more",
                  "value": "{{ if(steps.plan.more, '1', '0') }}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "chk",
            "kind": "if",
            "when": "steps.plan.checked",
            "then": [
              {
                "id": "chs",
                "kind": "action",
                "action": "store.put",
                "input": {
                  "store": "notion-ext.state",
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "name": "checked_at",
                      "value": "{{ env.now }}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "else": []
          },
          {
            "id": "done",
            "kind": "return",
            "value": {
              "ok": true,
              "message": "{{ steps.plan.message }}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requested": {
          "store": [
            "notion-ext.links",
            "notion-ext.state"
          ],
          "meta": [
            "pages",
            "pages-read",
            "databases"
          ],
          "web": [
            "*"
          ],
          "maxSteps": 20000
        },
        "triggers": [
          {
            "kind": "watch",
            "lambda": "notion.watch",
            "everySeconds": 15
          },
          {
            "kind": "schedule",
            "everyMinutes": 5
          }
        ],
        "sync": {
          "label": "Notion",
          "what": "Your Notion pages, databases and rows shared with the integration — both ways, close to live"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "parent": "i1",
      "kind": "page",
      "title": "Sync to Notion",
      "icon": "⬆️",
      "flow": {
        "name": "notion.push",
        "title": "Sync to Notion",
        "description": "What you change in Zeff under the page My Notion goes to Notion a few seconds after you stop typing: new pages, databases and rows, titles, icons, covers, a row's values, the blocks of a page's text that changed; moved to Zeff's trash, moved to Notion's.",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "type": "number"
          },
          {
            "name": "event",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "name": "field",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "pg",
            "kind": "action",
            "action": "meta.read",
            "input": {
              "op": "page.read",
              "args": {
                "id": "{{ input.page }}"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "root",
            "kind": "action",
            "action": "meta.read",
            "input": {
              "op": "page.read",
              "args": {
                "id": "@notion-ext.i2"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sch",
            "kind": "if",
            "when": "steps.pg.kind == 'database' or steps.pg.database",
            "then": [
              {
                "id": "sc",
                "kind": "action",
                "action": "meta.read",
                "input": {
                  "op": "schema",
                  "args": {
                    "database": "{{ steps.pg.database | default(steps.pg.id) }}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "else": []
          },
          {
            "id": "w",
            "kind": "action",
            "action": "lambda.invoke",
            "input": {
              "name": "notion.push",
              "event": {
                "page": "{{ steps.pg }}",
                "schema": "{{ steps.sc }}",
                "root": "{{ steps.root.id }}",
                "event": "{{ input.event }}",
                "field": "{{ input.field }}"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "put",
            "kind": "if",
            "when": "steps.w.put.length > 0",
            "then": [
              {
                "id": "p1",
                "kind": "action",
                "action": "store.put",
                "input": {
                  "store": "notion-ext.links",
                  "rows": "{{ steps.w.put }}"
                }
              }
            ],
            "else": []
          },
          {
            "id": "rm",
            "kind": "foreach",
            "items": "steps.w.remove",
            "as": "id",
            "max": 100,
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "d1",
                "kind": "action",
                "action": "store.delete",
                "input": {
                  "store": "notion-ext.links",
                  "where": {
                    "notion_id": "{{ id }}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "done",
            "kind": "return",
            "value": {
              "ok": true,
              "message": "{{ steps.w.message }}"
            }
